    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Three bedroom mid terrace property situated within the beautifully maintained development, Oakwood Manor and located within walking distance of the lovely heritage town of Kenmare. \r\n\r\nKenmare golf club is a very short stroll away.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of Entrance hall, open plan L-shaped kitchen/dining/living room and wc on the ground floor. \r\n\r\nThe first floor has three bedrooms (one en-suite) and main bathroom. \r\n\r\nThe attic area has been converted offering a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nMetered gas central heating throughout.\r\n\r\nMains water and sewerage.\r\n\r\nThere is private parking for 2 cars to the front and private garden at the rear with external access."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nL-shaped kitchen/dining/living: 3.36 M x 3.06 M x 4.86 M - Fitted kitchen units, wood floor. rear door access. open fire\r\n\r\nWC: 1.38 M x 1.83 M - tiled floor, wc & whb\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: \r\n\r\nBedroom: 2.12 M x 2.97 M - carpet flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom: 3.03 M x 2.98 M - carpet floor\r\n\r\nBedroom: 3.45 M x 3.59 M - carpet flooring\r\nEn-suite: 1.77 M x 1.61 M - tiled floor, shower, wc & whb\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: 1.96 M x 1.99 M - tiled floor, bath with shower over, wc & whb\r\n\r\nAttic area: 5.53 M x 4.63 M - velux windows"
      },
      {
